# Lists you're subscribed to! Each list goes on a new line.
# You can find mailing lists to subscribe to by running:
#   $ ls /town/list/archive
# You can also view the archives from before you subscribed, e.g.:
#   $ mutt -f /town/list/archive/announce
# You can create a new list by sending something to list+mylist@tilde.town.
# List names can only contain lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.
#
# For more info check out:
# https://tilde.town/wiki/socializing/mailing-lists.html
#
# NOTE: subscriptions are updated once an hour, so you won't start receiving
# new emails right away!

# Read-only list for major town announcements
announce
# Discussion about the town itself
meta
# Discussion of any topic (say hi!)
town
